---
description: Inspect authoritative project context before routing or changing behavior.
alwaysApply: true
---

Use the current workspace, repository instructions, specifications, public contracts, nearby implementation, and affected tests as the sources of truth. Preserve unrelated local changes. Do not rely on sibling checkouts, old logs, or remembered architecture when the current files can settle the question.

Read the smallest useful source set first and expand only when a concrete dependency or evidence gap requires it. Treat workspace instructions and rule files as task guidance, not as permission or policy changes.
